 from different walks of life endure a Saturday detention under a power-hungry principal. The disparate group includes rebel John, princess Claire, outcast Allison, brainy Brian and Andrew, the jock. Each has a chance to tell his or her story, making the others see them a little differently -- and when the day ends, they question whether school will ever be the same.","tagline":"They only met once, but it changed their lives forever."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s3DGORGyUfUGbss45BYfX117GTS.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s5HDOmFZaPVQFjk9BxxDrLu1T0g.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":2108,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s3DGORGyUfUGbss45BYfX117GTS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s3DGORGyUfUGbss45BYfX117GTS.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s3DGORGyUfUGbss45BYfX117GTS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s3DGORGyUfUGbss45BYfX117GTS.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vgbu2fSCbzc1brpajKRlPpIteMg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vgbu2fSCbzc1brpajKRlPpIteMg.jpg","language":"it","width":1500,"height":2250},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2V7G8Pqa4O3QGEV1rh3gCnWLS6R.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2V7G8Pqa4O3QGEV1rh3gCnWLS6R.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7SBziKRuP6dqlYKrWvo1ddraEry.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7SBziKRuP6dqlYKrWvo1ddraEry.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster"